<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42974" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scintillo</span></b> , āvi, 1, v.
			n.
		scintilla, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to sparkle</i>, <i>glitter</i>, <i>glow</i>, <i>gleam</i>, <i>flash</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-Aug. prose; cf. fulguro). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">templa caeli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 644</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulgetra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 43, 43, § 113</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clipeus ardens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					34, 34, § 100</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">testā ardente oleum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 392</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oculi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Men. 5, 2, 77</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carbunculi contra radios solis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 7, 25, § 95</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cristae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					7, 593</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scintillavit cruentis Ira genis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					9, 562</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tunc Venus et calidi scintillat fervor amoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Calp. 5, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cupiditatis ardor, qui scintillet in animis
					audientium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. Psa. 118</span></i>
			, Serm. 18, 22.</div>
